  "scope": "The actual 2140-slot original degeneracy dispatcher first runs the complete original-demand infeasibility scan, branches on its actual returned root, and either tags that original demand or restores the original saved context for the real avoiding-path scan. A positive result tags the literal original occurrence and path; total absence triggers the actual original-cost zero-mask allocator and tags that returned mask. The same append-only physical heap carries every child return and tag allocation. All three result variants exactly encode BinaryFractionalDispatch.dispatch; the independent input-only sum bound includes the final physical halt attempt. Thirteen physical cases check all variants, duplicate occurrence pointers, padding, absent paths, zero/positive interior vertices and global infeasibility priority. Zero masks may be recomputed by visited queries; no equality to the old logical operation count is claimed. Initial original input representations/widths, minimum-positive/guess preparation and the full solver join remain explicit.",
  "pending": [
    "independent semantic review",
    "combined production integration and exact CI"
  ]
